{"id":3882,"date":"2024-12-01T13:23:30","date_gmt":"2024-12-01T05:23:30","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3882"},"modified":"2024-12-01T13:27:53","modified_gmt":"2024-12-01T05:27:53","slug":"drum-filter-cloth","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=drum-filter-cloth","title":{"rendered":"Drum Filter Cloth"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"product-post\" data-elementor-id=\"3882\" class=\"elementor elementor-3882\" data-elementor-post-type=\"product\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-59b730d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"59b730d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cfeb4a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3cfeb4a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Work Principle of Vacuum Rotary Drum Filter<\/h3><p>The filtering surface vacuum drum filter through a continuous rotation of the drum, and connected to the drum room, the distribution of the rotating drum filter surface partition, when filtering surface operation to an area (suction), filtering operation can be performed.When it is transferred to another area (dry), can be carried out on the filter cake drying.Again to other area (washing,drying and discharging, filter cloth blanket), can be corresponding to the filter cake washing, secondary<br \/>drying, and through the discharging device of filter cake to discharge.Such as filtering slurry viscosity big, need to washing of filter cloth, after discharge, by installing the filter on both sides of the nozzle to washing of filter cloth, filter and then on to the next cycle.Drum rotation time, the cycle again.Complete the filtration, drying, washing, drying,unloading and regeneration of filter cloth and so on.In different regions at the same time, mechanical operation of the work, and form a continuous filtration.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3661d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b3661d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"892\" height=\"477\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/How-Drum-Filters-Work-detail1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3888\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/How-Drum-Filters-Work-detail1.jpg 892w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/How-Drum-Filters-Work-detail1-300x160.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/How-Drum-Filters-Work-detail1-768x411.jpg 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/How-Drum-Filters-Work-detail1-600x321.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 892px) 100vw, 892px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0787175 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0787175\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Applications<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Mining and Mineral Processing<\/strong>: For separating solids from slurries.<\/li><li><strong>Wastewater Treatment<\/strong>: Used in the filtration of water, removing suspended solids and other impurities.<\/li><li><strong>Food and Beverage Processing<\/strong>: For filtering liquids like juices, oils, and broths.<\/li><li><strong>Chemical Industries<\/strong>: To separate solids from chemical slurries or solutions.<\/li><\/ul><hr \/><h3>Technical Parameters for Common Drum Filter Cloth<\/h3><table><tbody><tr><td w